1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,339
Change your password
and temporary passwords.

2
00:00:03,339 --> 00:00:08,065
Change a password while signed in
and choose your own password when an

3
00:00:08,065 --> 00:00:10,221
administrator requires it.

4
00:00:11,806 --> 00:00:14,732
If you know your password
and want to change it,

5
00:00:14,732 --> 00:00:18,667
sign in normally and open
Sign-in methods from the header.

6
00:00:25,386 --> 00:00:30,307
Under Password, enter your current
password, a new passphrase twice,

7
00:00:30,307 --> 00:00:32,694
and a current authenticator code.

8
00:00:32,694 --> 00:00:37,002
An email code cannot replace
this authenticator check.

9
00:00:37,364 --> 00:00:39,719
Follow the minimum length shown.

10
00:00:39,719 --> 00:00:43,840
Passwords must match, must
differ from your current one,

11
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:47,331
and must pass the breached-password check.

12
00:00:49,983 --> 00:00:53,070
Correct the form and
choose Change password.

13
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:58,801
Your other sessions are signed out;
this browser continues in a new session.

14
00:01:07,285 --> 00:01:13,029
An administrator may give you a temporary
password and require a change at your next

15
00:01:13,029 --> 00:01:14,029
sign-in.

16
00:01:14,029 --> 00:01:18,054
First complete your password
and second-factor steps.

17
00:01:21,490 --> 00:01:24,808
Choose your own new
password before continuing.

18
00:01:24,808 --> 00:01:30,645
MERIT will keep returning to this page
until the required change is complete.

19
00:01:31,009 --> 00:01:37,152
You already verified this sign-in, so
this page asks only for your new password

20
00:01:37,152 --> 00:01:38,152
twice.

21
00:01:38,152 --> 00:01:41,196
Choose Save password and continue.

22
00:01:42,056 --> 00:01:45,165
Use your chosen password
for future sign-ins.

23
00:01:45,165 --> 00:01:50,208
Keep it private, and tell your
administrator if you receive an unexpected

24
00:01:50,208 --> 00:01:52,197
password-change notice.

25
00:01:57,581 --> 00:02:02,309
In this video you changed a password
using a current authenticator code,

26
00:02:02,309 --> 00:02:07,431
completed an administrator-required
password change, and verified sign-in with

27
00:02:07,431 --> 00:02:09,144
the chosen password.
